NotengOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/NotengOS, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the NotengOS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/NotengOS/android.git -b noteng-4.1 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
